OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed after man found with
OL,4,Astab wounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been jailed for three years
OL,7,Fand six months after a man was found
OL,8,Fwith suspected stab wounds in a
OL,9,FLincolnshire village.
OL,11,FThe man was taken to hospital after
OL,12,Fofficers were called to a property on
OL,13,FDixon Place, Dunholme, at about 20:00
OL,14,FBST on 1 April.
