OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed after man found with
OL,4,Astab wounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FMia Mcilwee, 41, of Dixon Place,
OL,7,FDunholme, appeared before Lincoln Crown
OL,8,FCourt on Friday for a Newton hearing,
OL,9,Fused when a defendant has pleaded
OL,10,Fguilty to an offence, but the
OL,11,Fprosecution and defence disagree on
OL,12,Fmaterial facts that could affect the
OL,13,Fsentence.
OL,15,FShe had admitted causing grievous
OL,16,Fbodily harm without intent at a hearing
OL,17,Fin August. Two further charges of
OL,18,Fattempted murder and wounding with
OL,19,Fintent, denied by Mcilwee, remain on
OL,20,Ffile.
